1.9.8 rule: Fire Bullets adds a Fire Bullets shot to every player shot instead of replacing it. projectile_spawn
keeps the shot and spawns the Fire Bullets shot first, through a recursive call that counts it as fired too, and
returns the shot's index; player_update has no Fire Bullets branch and no G key, so the weapon keeps its own cadence,
ammo, reloads and sound. Original bug 13's fix applies to both forms (patches/13-fire-bullets-owner.patch).
